### Xcode Project ###
*.xcodeproj/*
!*.xcodeproj/project.pbxproj  # Tracks project settings that generate Info.plist
!*.xcodeproj/xcshareddata/     # Shared schemes and settings for all developers

### Xcode Workspace (if applicable) ###
!*.xcworkspace/contents.xcworkspacedata  # Ensure the workspace file is tracked

### Ignore User-Specific Xcode Settings ###
*.xcuserstate
*.xcuserdatad/
*.xcworkspace/xcuserdata/
*.xcscmblueprint
.DS_Store

### Ignore Derived Data & Build Artifacts ###
DerivedData/
*.gcno
*.gcda
*.xccheckout
*.xcdebugger/

### Ignore Unnecessary Xcode Logs & Temp Files ###
*.xcuserstate
*.xcworkspace/xcuserdata/
*.xcscmblueprint
*.xcassets/.DS_Store
*.xcodeproj/project.xcworkspace/

### Ignore CocoaPods (if using) ###
Pods/

